<li id="mwqQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EN_13698-2?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="EN 13698-2 (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwqg" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["EN 13698-2"]}}'>EN 13698-2</a> Pallet production specification—Part 2: Construction specification for <span about="#mwt50" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwqw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cvt","href":"./Template:Cvt"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"1000"},"2":{"wt":"x"},"3":{"wt":"1200"},"4":{"wt":"mm"}},"i":0}}]}'>1,000</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt50"> </span><span about="#mwt50">mm ×</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt50"> </span><span about="#mwt50">1,200</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt50"> </span><span about="#mwt50">mm (39</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt50"> </span><span about="#mwt50">in ×</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt50"> </span><span about="#mwt50">47</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt50"> </span><span about="#mwt50">in)</span> flat wooden pallets</li></ul></li>
